[1.214, "o", "---\r\ntitle: Sample paper\r\n---\r\n\r\nThe tidyverse [@doi:10.21105/joss.01686] is a coherent grammar for data\r\nmanipulation in R. Single-cell integration approaches like Seurat\r\n[@doi:10.1101/460147] handle the bioRxiv preprint side. Transformer\r\narchitectures [@arxiv:1706.03762] underlie current AI tooling, and\r\n"]
[1.206, "o", "\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[1;32m$\u001b[0m quartobot scan .\r\n"]
